# Matrixx v12.3 | Android 16 QPR2

### Initial Official Release for CMF Phone 1 (Tetris)

#### Device Changelog

* Initial Matrixx Android 16 QPR2 bring-up
* Updated to Matrixx v12.3 sources
* Synced with latest Matrixx upstream changes
* Added OTA support
* Improved system stability and performance
* Updated vendor and proprietary blobs
* Updated kernel sources
* SELinux Enforcing
* CTS passing
* SafetyNet compatible
* Fixed various device-specific issues
* General bug fixes and optimizations

#### Notes

* Clean flash is recommended when coming from another ROM.
* Report issues with proper logs.
* Use the recommended recovery version.

